00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:29.375
That is what I was saying
about a notebook friendly API.

00:19:29.375 --> 00:19:32.180
I like working in
notebooks, because I

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:35.600
can do data preparation and
visually eyeball my data set.

00:19:35.600 --> 00:19:37.220
